<DocLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Styleum collects, uses and protects your information, including every AI service involved and what it sees." kicker="Legal" updated="February 11, 2025">
  <p>Styleum ("we," "our," or "us") is operated by Sameer Studios LLC. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our mobile application Styleum (the "App").</p>
  
  <p>Please read this Privacy Policy carefully. By using the App, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy.</p>
  
  <div class="divider"></div>
  
  <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
  
  <h3>1.1 Information You Provide Directly</h3>
  <ul>
      <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> When you create an account, we collect your email address and authentication credentials. If you use Sign in with Apple, we receive the information you authorize Apple to share.</li>
      <li><strong>Profile Information:</strong> Name, style preferences, and any information you provide during onboarding.</li>
      <li><strong>Wardrobe Images:</strong> Photos of clothing items you upload to the App. These images are stored securely and used solely to provide outfit recommendations.</li>
      <li><strong>Feedback and Communications:</strong> Any messages, feedback, or support requests you send to us.</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>1.2 Information Collected Automatically</h3>
  <ul>
      <li><strong>Location Data:</strong> With your permission, we collect your approximate location to provide weather-appropriate outfit recommendations. You can disable location access in your device settings at any time.</li>
      <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> We may collect device type, operating system version, and unique device identifiers for app functionality and troubleshooting.</li>
      <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Information about how you interact with the App, including features used, outfits viewed, and items marked as worn.</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>1.3 Information from Third-Party Services</h3>
  <p>If you choose to link or sign in through third-party services (such as Apple), we may receive information from those services as permitted by your settings with that service.</p>
  
  <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
  <ul>
      <li><strong>Provide and Maintain the App:</strong> Generate personalized outfit recommendations based on your wardrobe, preferences, and local weather conditions.</li>
      <li><strong>Process Your Wardrobe:</strong> Analyze uploaded clothing images using artificial intelligence to identify items, colors, and styles.</li>
      <li><strong>Improve Our Services:</strong> Understand how users interact with the App to enhance features and user experience.</li>
      <li><strong>Communicate With You:</strong> Send service-related announcements, respond to inquiries, and provide customer support.</li>
      <li><strong>Process Transactions:</strong> Handle subscription payments and manage your account.</li>
      <li><strong>Ensure Security:</strong> Detect, prevent, and address technical issues, fraud, or illegal activity.</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h2>3. How We Share Your Information</h2>
  <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your information in the following circumstances:</p>
  
  <h3>3.1 Service Providers</h3>
  <p>We work with third-party companies to help us operate and improve the App:</p>
  <ul>
      <li><strong>Supabase:</strong> Database hosting, user authentication, and secure file storage.</li>
      <li><strong>RunPod:</strong> AI image processing services (background removal, fashion embeddings). See Section 4 for details.</li>
      <li><strong>Replicate:</strong> AI vision analysis for wardrobe item identification. See Section 4 for details.</li>
      <li><strong>OpenRouter / Google Gemini:</strong> AI services for outfit generation and styling recommendations. See Section 4 for details.</li>
      <li><strong>OpenWeather:</strong> Weather data for location-aware outfit recommendations. See Section 4 for details.</li>
      <li><strong>RevenueCat:</strong> Subscription and payment processing.</li>
      <li><strong>Apple:</strong> Authentication services (Sign in with Apple).</li>
  </ul>
  <p>These providers only have access to the information necessary to perform their services and are obligated to protect your information.</p>
  
  <h3>3.2 Legal Requirements</h3>
  <p>We may disclose your information if required to do so by law or in response to valid requests by public authorities.</p>
  
  <h3>3.3 Business Transfers</h3>
  <p>If Sameer Studios LLC is involved in a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets, your information may be transferred as part of that transaction.</p>
  
  <h2>4. AI Services & Data Processing</h2>
  <p>Styleum uses several third-party AI services to process your wardrobe data and generate outfit recommendations. Below is a detailed breakdown of each service, what data is sent, and how it is handled.</p>

  <h3>4.1 BiRefNet (hosted on RunPod)</h3>
  <ul>
      <li><strong>Data sent:</strong> Wardrobe photos</li>
      <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> Background removal from clothing images</li>
      <li><strong>Data retention:</strong> Processed in real-time, not stored by the service</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>4.2 Florence-2 (hosted on Replicate)</h3>
  <ul>
      <li><strong>Data sent:</strong> Wardrobe photos (background-removed)</li>
      <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> Vision analysis to identify clothing type, color, pattern, material, and style</li>
      <li><strong>Data retention:</strong> Processed in real-time, not stored by the service</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>4.3 FashionSigLIP (hosted on RunPod)</h3>
  <ul>
      <li><strong>Data sent:</strong> Wardrobe photos (background-removed)</li>
      <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> Generate fashion-specific embeddings for outfit matching algorithms</li>
      <li><strong>Data retention:</strong> Processed in real-time, not stored by the service</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>4.4 Google Gemini (via OpenRouter)</h3>
  <ul>
      <li><strong>Data sent:</strong> Clothing item descriptions, style preferences, weather data</li>
      <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> Generate outfit descriptions, styling tips, and recommendations</li>
      <li><strong>Data retention:</strong> Subject to Google's API data policies. See <a href="https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Gemini API Terms of Service</a> for details.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>4.5 OpenWeather API</h3>
  <ul>
      <li><strong>Data sent:</strong> User's approximate location (city-level)</li>
      <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> Weather-aware outfit recommendations</li>
      <li><strong>Data retention:</strong> No personal data stored</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>4.6 Important: Your Data & AI Training</h3>
  <p><strong>Your wardrobe photos and personal data are NOT used to train any AI models.</strong> Data is processed solely for the purpose of generating your outfit recommendations. No images or personal information are retained by third-party AI services beyond the time required to process your request.</p>

  <h2>5. Data Storage and Security</h2>
  
  <h3>5.1 Storage</h3>
  <p>Your data is stored on secure servers provided by Supabase, with data centers located in the United States. Wardrobe images are stored in encrypted cloud storage.</p>
  
  <h3>5.2 Security Measures</h3>
  <p>We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal information, including:</p>
  <ul>
      <li>Encryption of data in transit (HTTPS/TLS)</li>
      <li>Encryption of data at rest</li>
      <li>Secure authentication protocols</li>
      <li>Regular security assessments</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>5.3 Retention</h3>
  <p>We retain your personal information for as long as your account is active or as needed to provide you services. You may request deletion of your account and associated data at any time.</p>
  
  <h2>6. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
  
  <h3>6.1 All Users</h3>
  <p>You have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
      <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of the personal information we hold about you.</li>
      <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate personal information.</li>
      <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of your account and personal data.</li>
      <li><strong>Portability:</strong> Request your data in a portable format.</li>
      <li><strong>Withdraw Consent:</strong> Withdraw consent for location tracking or other optional data collection at any time.</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>6.2 California Residents (CCPA)</h3>
  <p>If you are a California resident, you have additional rights under the California Consumer Privacy Act:</p>
  <ul>
      <li>Right to know what personal information is collected, used, shared, or sold</li>
      <li>Right to delete personal information held by businesses</li>
      <li>Right to opt-out of sale of personal information (we do not sell personal information)</li>
      <li>Right to non-discrimination for exercising your privacy rights</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>6.3 European Users (GDPR)</h3>
  <p>If you are located in the European Economic Area, you have additional rights under the General Data Protection Regulation:</p>
  <ul>
      <li>Right to access, rectify, or erase your personal data</li>
      <li>Right to restrict or object to processing</li>
      <li>Right to data portability</li>
      <li>Right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h2>7. How to Delete Your Account and Data</h2>
  <p>You can delete your account and all associated data at any time:</p>
  <ol>
      <li>Open the Styleum app</li>
      <li>Go to Profile → Settings</li>
      <li>Tap "Delete Account"</li>
      <li>Confirm deletion</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Upon deletion, your account will be immediately deactivated and all personal data will be permanently deleted within 30 days.</p>
  <p>Alternatively, you can request account deletion by emailing <a href="mailto:privacy@sameerstudios.co">privacy@sameerstudios.co</a>.</p>
  
  <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>The App is not intended for children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If we discover that a child under 13 has provided us with personal information, we will delete such information immediately.</p>
  
  <h2>9. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy in the App and updating the "Last Updated" date.</p>
  
  <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
  <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:</p>
  
  <div class="contact-box">
      <p><strong>Sameer Studios LLC</strong></p>
      <p>Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@sameerstudios.co">privacy@sameerstudios.co</a></p>
      <p>Website: <a href="https://styleum.xyz">https://styleum.xyz</a></p>
  </div>
